$\\,$ If $7$ is composite, then $\\pi \\in Z.$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186573941 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186059691 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "ec5acb94-b33a-5921-b761-6f78db3f25f7" :knowledge-point/title "Finding the Converse of a Statement"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "2c129689-b5bd-58bd-9bcc-56e88f576060" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "If there are no clouds in the sky, then it is raining." :db/id #edb/ref 17592186573475} {:answer/id #uuid "312f8959-8151-55bc-ae36-b3e5cf81b6a0" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "If there are clouds in the sky, then it is raining." :db/id #edb/ref 17592186573487} {:answer/id #uuid "70a461f5-db33-5b7c-aa9e-9566d06e978a" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "If it is not raining, then there are clouds in the sky." :db/id #edb/ref 17592186573565} {:answer/id #uuid "c6543775-ffb9-5ddf-9b7e-8bcf00f9bce9" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "If it is not raining, then there are no clouds in the sky." :db/id #edb/ref 17592186573679} {:answer/id #uuid "d344732a-f1b2-59c9-9277-d6318893d1da" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "If it is raining, then there are clouds in the sky." :db/id #edb/ref 17592186573703}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "c6543775-ffb9-5ddf-9b7e-8bcf00f9bce9" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "If it is not raining, then there are no clouds in the sky." :db/id #edb/ref 17592186573679} :answer-field/id #uuid "3487f4d3-26c2-5195-8f9e-8f16732f1ffc" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045493 :db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186573790}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045487 :db/ident :question.difficulty/moderate} :question/id #uuid "ecab2b8f-98e3-5f6d-b4a6-b5491b118c68" :question/math-academy-id "q-183294" :question/problem "Find the converse of the following statement: \n\n$\\,$ **If** there are no clouds in the sky, **then** it is not raining." :question/worked-solution "In our conditional statement:\n\n- The antecedent is $A:$ There are no clouds in the sky.\n\n- The consequent is $B:$ It is not raining.\n\nThe converse of a conditional statement $A⇒B$ is given by \n\n$$\nB⇒A.\n$$\n\nTherefore, the converse is the following: \n\n$\\,$ If it is not raining, then there are no clouds in the sky."}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186407671 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186059693 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "7f58ec96-53b3-5317-9801-c730728f32c6" :knowledge-point/title "Finding the Contrapositive of a Statement"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "07403375-0a14-5e0c-9b83-f1f7a1d8d5eb" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "If $4>6,$ then ${0}⊄{1,2,3}.$" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186407637} {:answer/id #uuid "41036f0e-f48f-54b0-ad45-917785a0ae65" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "If ${0}⊄{1,2,3},$ then $4>6.$" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186407642} {:answer/id #uuid "4b732aa6-c0fa-544f-860e-c7f782bacec2" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "If $4\\le 6,$ then ${0}⊄{1,2,3}.$" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186407643} {:answer/id #uuid "a4fd80e3-a875-5579-b274-b169a9611ea3" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "If ${0}⊄{1,2,3},$ then $4\\le 6.$" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186407653} {:answer/id #uuid "cad940a3-7a30-5ff4-93a8-409b9be10a0f" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "If $4>6,$ then ${0}⊂{1,2,3}.$" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186407658}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "4b732aa6-c0fa-544f-860e-c7f782bacec2" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "If $4\\le 6,$ then ${0}⊄{1,2,3}.$" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186407643} :answer-field/id #uuid "e647ef76-2240-59c3-8c83-9a4ef59a40a3" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045493 :db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186407665}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045485 :db/ident :question.difficulty/easy} :question/id #uuid "fa1fdfba-09c3-560d-b8ff-6308784b3029" :question/math-academy-id "q-183337" :question/problem "Find the contrapositive of the following statement: \n\n$\\,$ **If** ${0}⊂{1,2,3},$ **then** $4>6.$" :question/worked-solution "In our conditional statement:\n\n- The antecedent is $A:$ ${0}⊂{1,2,3}.$\n\n- The consequent is $B:$ $4>6.$\n\nThe contrapositive of a conditional statement $A⇒B$ is given by \n\n$$\n¬B⇒¬A.\n$$\n\nFirst, we write down the negations of $A$ and $B:$\n\n- $¬A:$ ${0}⊄{1,2,3}.$\n\n- $¬B:$ $4\\le 6.$\n\nTherefore, the contrapositive is the following: \n\n$\\,$ If $4\\le 6,$ then ${0}⊄{1,2,3}.$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186379302 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186059693 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "7f58ec96-53b3-5317-9801-c730728f32c6" :knowledge-point/title "Finding the Contrapositive of a Statement"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "6d974fef-0591-53d0-b35e-d52dfc386c2d" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "If the boss is upset, then Mary isn't late for work." :db/id #edb/ref 17592186379304} {:answer/id #uuid "5e35ac60-e938-54c4-a5d3-8b8dce669e4e" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "If the boss isn't upset, then Mary isn't late for work." :db/id #edb/ref 17592186379305} {:answer/id #uuid "85989ce3-3968-511f-b078-9a4331515a2a" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "If the boss is upset, then Mary is late for work." :db/id #edb/ref 17592186379306} {:answer/id #uuid "dcd8303a-57fa-5b47-8261-a70b0647b7a6" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "If Mary is late for work, then the boss is upset." :db/id #edb/ref 17592186379307} {:answer/id #uuid "289c0370-99d1-5dbe-8e1d-e4422b14a439" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "If Mary is late for work, then the boss isn't upset." :db/id #edb/ref 17592186379308}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "85989ce3-3968-511f-b078-9a4331515a2a" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "If the boss is upset, then Mary is late for work." :db/id #edb/ref 17592186379306} :answer-field/id #uuid "021582f7-8001-5664-a588-9b42dd988d13" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045493 :db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186379303}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045487 :db/ident :question.difficulty/moderate} :question/id #uuid "b93ad28c-284b-5047-bc76-7d7c2c9ce372" :question/math-academy-id "q-183338" :question/problem "Find the contrapositive of the following statement:\n\n$\\,$ **If** Mary isn't late for work, **then** the boss isn't upset." :question/worked-solution "In our conditional statement: \n\n- The antecedent is $A:$ Mary isn't late for work.\n\n- The consequent is $B:$  The boss isn't upset.\n\nThe contrapositive of a conditional statement $A⇒B$ is given by \n\n$$\n¬B⇒¬A.\n$$\n\nFirst, we write down the negations of $A$ and $B:$\n\n- $¬A:$ Mary is late for work.\n\n- $¬B:$ The boss is upset.\n\nTherefore, the contrapositive is the following: \n\n$\\,$ If the boss is upset, then Mary is late for work."}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186379309 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186059694 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "93d3501b-96ef-5fbd-9d93-788021156ddb" :knowledge-point/title "Identifying Logically Equivalent Statements"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "a5c38a40-b0ad-50a0-b1fd-3ca0ed423d28" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186471221} {:answer/id #uuid "b4471eda-3004-561c-b183-28b096dbfdb7" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186471222}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "a5c38a40-b0ad-50a0-b1fd-3ca0ed423d28" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186471221} :answer-field/id #uuid "eb1c9fc7-d87b-54a3-a66e-faa888700146" :answer-field/key "I" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186472116} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "e3ed57af-e278-5ede-a755-783ce9ed8c4d" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186471223} {:answer/id #uuid "761ff025-d2e6-53d2-985e-4816ac004c2e" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186471224}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "761ff025-d2e6-53d2-985e-4816ac004c2e" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186471224} :answer-field/id #uuid "cc9e2ea8-4854-5a7a-8552-15585b54efc9" :answer-field/key "II" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186472117} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "7f4f384a-3166-5f09-b657-4055cb82802e" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186471225} {:answer/id #uuid "8cc1fc9d-3e88-590e-be39-355512cb0a6c" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186471226}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "7f4f384a-3166-5f09-b657-4055cb82802e" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186471225} :answer-field/id #uuid "c34ffd8a-bcff-52d9-a081-61d20b6aec70" :answer-field/key "III" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186472118}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045485 :db/ident :question.difficulty/easy} :question/id #uuid "8d0274f7-9e96-5c91-af2a-50bf61bf0ba6" :question/math-academy-id "q-183341" :question/problem "$\\,$ **If** $8$ is even **then** $4\\in {2,4,8}.$ \n\nWhich of the following statements are equivalent to the conditional statement above?\n- **I.** If $4\\in {2,4,8},$ then $8$ is even.\n- **II.** If $4\\notin {2,4,8},$ then $8$ is not even.\n- **III.** If $8$ is not even, then $4\\notin {2,4,8}.$\n\nSelect all that apply. If none apply, leave all boxes unchecked." :question/worked-solution "Let's recall the following facts:\n\n- The contrapositive is logically equivalent to the original statement.\n\n- The inverse and the converse are logically equivalent to each other, but not to the original statement.\n\n![](images/0d/0deb19675402bf931111bb80cb616682aac08491b5cd3e1ab5812da05b6df8a8.png)\n\nSo, we are looking for the contrapositive of the given statement.\n\n- Statement I is the converse, not the contrapositive. $\\,\\times $\n\n- Statement II is the contrapositive. $\\,✓$\n\n- Statement III is the inverse, not the contrapositive. $\\,\\times $\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is \"II only.\""}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186060413 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186059692 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "dffa4760-00cb-5395-8fab-dc7f9fe20597" :knowledge-point/title "Finding the Inverse of a Statement"}] :question